sequenceDiagram
    %% Sequence Diagram: Object Communication Flow for Donations
    autonumber
    
    actor Donor as Donor (Browser)
    participant Worker as Cloudflare Worker Entry
    participant Router as Hono API (/api/donate/checkout)
    participant Stripe as Stripe Gateway API
    participant D1 as D1 Database (SQLite)
    participant Page as React Router Loader (/donate)

    Donor->>Worker: POST /donate (Form details)
    Worker->>Router: Forward to checkout handler
    Router->>Stripe: create session (amount, metadata)
    Stripe-->>Router: return session URL & ID
    Router->>D1: INSERT INTO donations (status = 'pending')
    D1-->>Router: confirm write
    Router-->>Worker: return Checkout URL
    Worker-->>Donor: Redirect to Stripe Portal
    
    Note over Donor, Stripe: Donor completes secure card verification
    
    Stripe-->>Donor: Redirect to /donate?success=true&session_id={ID}
    Donor->>Worker: GET /donate?success=true&session_id={ID}
    Worker->>Page: Trigger Route Loader
    Page->>Stripe: retrieve session status by ID
    Stripe-->>Page: return status = 'paid'
    Page->>D1: SELECT status FROM donations WHERE session_id
    D1-->>Page: returns status = 'pending'
    Page->>D1: UPDATE donations SET status = 'success'
    D1-->>Page: confirm update
    Page->>D1: UPDATE programs SET raised_amount = raised_amount + amount
    D1-->>Page: confirm update
    Page-->>Worker: Compile styled success page HTML
    Worker-->>Donor: Render "Thank You" screen
